  "question": {
    "text": "<p><strong>Statement - I :&nbsp;</strong>The value of the integral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><strong>Statement - II :&nbsp;</strong><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
